			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Explosive Personalities"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dAside from the usual Nether goodies you'll want to find, Bandit, there are two FOP Corporate Bosses that call this magma sea their home, and you'll need some materials to get their attention."
				""
				"&5First you'll want to find a Crimson Forest or a Nether Wastes biome. In either one of these, you'll find a Little Bam. Its a very short little red guy, looks kinda happy."
				""
				"&dPunch it. Or shoot it. Or something. It's actually dangerous and attacks with explosions, be careful."
				""
				"&5The main thing it drops that you want is an Explosive Idol. Be sure to pick it up fast, otherwise you might get the Boss's attention too early."
				""
				"&dWhile you are searching, I suggest fighting every hostile creature you see. One of them should drop some Flammable Dust."
			]
			dependencies: ["1881243BF68F0FAC"]
			id: "2EC8B80AE1A271D5"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "3F9BB469CC952CB2"
					type: "kill"
					entity: "aoa3:little_bam"
					value: 1L
				}
				{
					id: "02FFBCAFFB554E41"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:explosive_idol"
				}
				{
					id: "31E0852D6D3ECAF9"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:flammable_dust"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "57FE043DE4C905F7"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "An Old Enemy"
			x: -4.25d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&dOh, Bandit, if you haven't yet, you should probably fight The Wither with some of your newer gear. "
				""
				"&5Especially as it'll prepare you for the much more... dangerous fights."
				""
				"&dThe FOP Corporate Bosses are no pushover, so fighting The Wither is good practice."
				""
				"&5As a refresher: You need four Soul Sand and three Wither Skulls, from Wither Skeletons that 'usually' spawn in Nether Fortresses."
				""
				"&dSeems you can find them wandering around more due to the hex land borders being Nether Bricks too."
			]
			dependencies: ["2EC8B80AE1A271D5"]
			id: "46082D6F0590EDD4"
			tasks: [{
				id: "786239324022D29A"
				type: "kill"
				entity: "minecraft:wither"
				value: 1L
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "2DC40071E3BCF9F5"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Boom Boom Boom"
			x: -5.5d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dThat Explosive Idol is used just like the Troll Idol you made to summon Smash."
				""
				"&5Just throw it to the ground when ready. But you might want to make sure you got a large arena, with some high walls."
				""
				"&dThe Little Bams' explosions will knock you around if you didn't notice already. And the boss, well..."
				""
				"&5King BamBamBam used to be a manager that loved to throw 4th of July parties. All the time."
				""
				"&dObsessed with fireworks and explosives. And had an... explosive personality when it came to anyone who didn't like explosions."
				""
				"&5Was a really bad time if you were, say, a Veteran with some PTSD in his office..."
			]
			dependencies: ["2EC8B80AE1A271D5"]
			id: "7628C2ED0041C6FD"
			tasks: [{
				id: "491637FC0DE9A093"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:explosive_idol"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "72FB27C46A56D4DB"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "KING BAMBAMBAM"
			x: -4.5d
			y: -2.25d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&dRight, as we said, if you want to square off against King BamBamBam, you'll want to make sure the area you summon him is pretty large, relatively flat...."
				""
				"&5And has a pretty high wall. Or, hopefully you picked up a grappling hook like I suggested. "
				""
				"&dKing BamBamBam is pretty dangerous, not just himself, but he constantly summons Little Bam's to his aid. If you don't have Knockback or Blast Resistant gear, or can't kill them fast enough, they'll be bouncing you around like a Super Ball in a cement mixer."
				""
				"&5If you do manage to beat him, he can drop some pretty nice stuff. Including his Explosive Armor, which will absorb bigger explosions the more pieces you are wearing."
			]
			dependencies: ["7628C2ED0041C6FD"]
			id: "0947F0113D4D1E31"
