				""
				"&5All kinds of explosions. So, I think to bribe him we'll need a whole pile of explosives."
				""
				"&dSo, a bunch of TNT, some grenades, and of course fireworks. "
				""
				"&5And to sweeten the deal, of course some Scrypto."
			]
