		{
			title: "A Beastly Search"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dThat Flammable Dust is going to take a bit of... well, processing before you can use it to get the attention of one of the Nether's FOP Corporate Bosses."
				""
				"&5You'll need to search low in the Nether, around Y 25 to 35. What you want looks like a pyramid made of Nether Brick with white lamps. Maybe using a Scanner to look for Nether Bricks would help...check the Shop Tablet, Bandit, we sell more Scanners."
				""
				"&dThese are called the Nethengenic Pits. Inside it they've placed a spawner for Nethengenic Beasts. These are Hunter creatures, so..."
				""
				"&5But not to feed them the Flammable Dust and turn it into Nethengenic Callstone."
				""
				"&dThough, doing scans with your Q.U.E.S.T. Tablet, I'm finding it hard to get the Nethegenic Beast's signature... I should be able to get a one shot summoning egg for you. Check the Shop Tablet."
			]
			dependencies: ["2EC8B80AE1A271D5"]
			id: "1EEA73200A84046B"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "4C885D7D42E74BAA"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:flammable_dust"
				}
				{
					id: "20740729FBC627C0"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:nethengeic_callstone"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "74B792A9B4FCFEC1"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Flight of the Demon"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dNow that you have the Nethengeic Callstone, you can get the attention of the Nethengeic Wither."
				""
				"&5This boss is an interesting one. They love flying, even for a bird. They took every opportunity to attend work conventions, visit remote offices, anything and everything to fly via aircraft, spaceship, or whatever else."
				""
				"&dTried to run the office with an iron fist on top of that, not caring what time zone the travels took them, so would call any hour of the night and order all sorts of projects, changes to projects, tps reports, overtime, etc etc."
				""
				"&5Can guess how fast they churned through staff. But it seems FOP Corporate was happy enough that they let them become the Nethergeic Wither boss."
			]
			dependencies: ["1EEA73200A84046B"]
			id: "4C0BA5EEB2D425DC"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4B1E5616BB27CE2B"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:nethengeic_callstone"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "5B02472631747A88"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -5.5d
			y: 3.25d
			shape: "square"
			description: ["&5The Nether has a bunch of extra creatures in it courtesy of The FOP. They can be pretty tough, a few of them are Hunter mobs too so be sure to be leveling your Hunter skill as well"]
			dependencies: ["1EEA73200A84046B"]
