		{
			title: "Embrakes and Flamewalkers"
			x: -5.0d
			y: 4.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&5The Embrake is a creature that you can find in Nether Waste and Crimson Forest type biomes in The Nether. "
				""
				"&5It's attacks are dangerous, both setting you and the ground on fire if you are standing on it and not, say, jumping or flying."
				""
				"&5Embrakes drop Sharp Claws, good for various crafts."
				""
				"&5The Flamewalker can be found in Nether Wastes and Crimson Forest type biomes. "
				""
				"&5While fighting you, the Flamewalker will leave a trail of fire wherever it walks. Be careful, this fire can burn items that drop!"
			]
			dependencies: ["3D9169CE6A156097"]
