		{
			title: "Burn and Wither"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 1.75d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&dFighting the Nethengeic Wither takes a bit of preparation."
				""
				"&5We suggest whatever healing potions, cure potions, and whatnot you can find. Oh, and anything that aids your jumping, that'll help."
				""
				"&dThe Nethengeic Wither flies, Bandit. They'll float and fly around you, launching explosive shots that inflict Wither on you."
				""
				"&5So either weather the hits out if you can't dodge them, or get some potions going to dampen them."
				""
				"&dIf you are ready, Bandit, the same deal here : Take that Nethergeic Core and throw it to the ground, and wait to attract their attention!"
			]
			dependencies: ["4C0BA5EEB2D425DC"]
			id: "2A0AE4C5FF47FED5"
