		{
			title: "Airfare Fare"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS BRIBE"
			description: [
				"&dThe best way to the Nethengeic Wither's heart is, of course, airline related. Or, more specifically, via their airline accustomed stomach."
				""
				"&5Airline food always has this.... certain feel and air about it. Even if you are first class, most of it just feels slightly off. Or maybe thats just us."
				""
				"&dWell, I think to convince them to step aside is to bring them various airline meals. They can't really fly on airplanes anymore, so bringing back fond memories, as well as reminding them of being a bird with some Feathers. You'll have to get the Cooking Grandma DLC though..."
				""
				"&5And airline food from ALL classes. They didn't care where they sat, so they had the full gambit from 1st class gourmet to coach bag o' peanuts."
			]
			dependencies: ["4C0BA5EEB2D425DC"]
