		{
			title: "Wings Clipped"
			x: -3.5d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dFantastic, Bandit. You've grounded this boss for the time being."
				""
				"&5I know you are trying to get out as soon as possible, Bandit, but keep in mind there are dozens of worlds to go, so its going to take a while. Rushing now might get overwhelming quickly."
				""
				"&dTake a breather. Work on a different project. Maybe start building up a Colony? Or focus on some DLC for a bit, maybe cooking."
				""
				"&5Whichever you feel like doing, once both bosses are down, we can head into the next world: Lelyatia."
