		{
			title: "To the Twinside Forest"
			x: -2.75d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, before you head in (if you haven't already that is!), you'll want to be prepared with a few things."
				""
				"&5That grappling hook I mentioned earlier would be a good start."
				""
				"&dBro."
				""
				"&5Sorry sorry. Grappling hooks are super useful, okay? Well, some Jump Boost potions, or feather fall, or a parachute or something. Something to negate fall damage until you can find certain helpful tools."
				""
				"&dEither way, as always when jumping to another world, only bring what you need. Just in case."
