		{
			title: "Infernals and Little Bams"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 4.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&5Infernals are rare creatures that can spawn in Crimson Forests and Nether Wastes type biomes."
				""
				"&5If you are hit by an Infernal, you will be knocked back far if you don't have any protection. If you hit an Infernal with a melee attack, you will be set on fire, so be careful."
				""
				"&5Little Bams you have already encountered. But all the same, fighting more of them is a good idea."
