		{
			title: "Nethengeic Beasts"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 4.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&5As mentioned, Nethengeic Beasts spawn in Nethengeic Pits. A pretty rare building the FOP Added to the Nether at some point, but forgot to update it with all the changes they've done. So you can also find these in the Shop Tablet for sale if you really need them."
				""
				"&5Nethengeic Beasts have a rare chance of dropping Nethengeic Armor pieces. Each piece worn lets you deal extra damage to mobs on fire. When a full set is worn, when YOU are on fire, you deal extra damage. And the two damage boosts WILL stack."
				""
				"&5Scrubby's are creatures that can be found in the Crimson Forest and Nether Wastes type biomes. "
				""
				"&5If you are hit by a Scrubby, you will be set on fire."
			]
			dependencies: ["3D9169CE6A156097"]
