			y: -4.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dIf you want to maximize the use of Magic Repair Dust, you'll want to turn it into Magic Mending Compound."
				""
				"&dYou'll need to make a Metal Tub, and get three Magic Repair Dust. Also, a Bucket of Lava. Yes, this is kind of like making craft putty at home, except with magic dust and lava instead of salt, flour, and water."
				""
				"&dAnyways, combine the items, and you'll get the Empty Bucket back, but also a Tub of Magic Mending Solution."
				""
				"&dNow just leave that Tub in your inventory for a while, and it'll turn the Solution into a Compound! This will fully repair most items with the Mending Station."
