		{
			title: "Upside Down"
			x: -0.75d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "And Rightside Up"
			description: [
				"&dWatch your step Bandit! Lelyetia is very different than what you are used to, I would hazard a guess."
				""
				"&5Each of the worlds the FOP digitizes into their FOP Game Server usually just replace older worlds that have few resources left."
				""
				"&dThey aim to replace worlds with similar characteristics, so their 'regular' users aren't confused. Worlds like Lelyetia are what they call \"Twosided\". Instead of a deep ground with caves, these worlds have a Top Side and an Under Side, floating endless islands surrounding an empty Void as the core of the planet."
				""
				"&5Be careful where you step. But if you do fall into the void, you have a good chance of reappearing in the sky. The FOP gives you some fall protection, but... don't rely on it."
				""
				"&dFor other weird things? Grab some of that grass... or should I say Stone?"
			]
			dependencies: ["1799D40CDE8D8F82"]
			id: "72FAD25A9DA18C65"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7E27744A43339606"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:lelyetian_stone"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "44C2A80D872E7A10"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Sporetacular"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dSee what I mean? That grass grows on Leyletian Stone, which is...very much like Dirt. But also Stone?"
				""
				"&5Be sure to mark the portal on the Map, then head out and explore. The Top Side will be safer to search."
				""
				"&dBut you WILL need to go to the Under Side at some point. You'll need a good way to get around the upside down trees and landscape."
				""
				"&5Grappling hooks."
				""
				"&dAs there are a lot of structures the current Leyletians have built. We'll get to those in a minute, but you are looking for two things on the Top Side : "
				""
				"&5A thin, tall pillar with a Graw Altar on top. Mark its location for later."
				""
				"&dAnd you want to loot all chests and fight all hostile creatures along the way. You need to find Yellow and/or Orange Spores."
			]
			dependencies: ["72FAD25A9DA18C65"]
			id: "391277708CA4B52A"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "0791F76299B15935"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:yellow_spores"
				}
				{
					id: "7C26B3F2E76C1A81"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:orange_spores"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "320D9662FCFBE099"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "An Eye For An...."
			x: 3.25d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, you got the spores. Good work! Hopefully you found one of those towers with a Graw Altar on it. "
				""
				"&5What you need to do is climb up to that Graw Altar, and Right Click one of those Spores onto it. This will cause a glowing Flye to spawn."
				""
				"&dDefeat that Flye to get a Guardian's Eye. This is what you'll need to attract the attention of Graw, the next FOP Corporate Boss."
				""
				"&5Graw used to be in charge of some of the FOP's land acquisition and development outside of their digital world. They pulled every dirty trick in the book to acquire land and expand the FOP's physical land holdings."
				""
				"&dThey did so well they were given sole command of the Leyletia world, becoming the Forest Guardian."
			]
			dependencies: ["391277708CA4B52A"]
			id: "4D05DB966C33B676"
			tasks: [{
				id: "10520EB05BDAEA6F"
				type: "item"
